This project demonstrates a comprehensive ArrayList contract test covering LastIndexOf method. We use Visual Studio 2010 and Microsoft Fakes Framework for creating these contract tests.

We will test LastIndexOf method for multiple purposes,

* Check if it returns the last index of an element in ArrayList.
* Check if it can handle an ArrayList list with duplicate elements.
* Check if it returns -1 when the element does not exist in the ArrayList.
* Validate the behavior when item is null.

